{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Base components created:\n- Tab Item set 8:10 (children: State=Default, State=Active)\n- Tab Bar 8:11\n- Header / Home 8:36\n- Header / Back 8:43\n- Header / Detail 8:51\n- Chip set 8:69 (State=Default, State=Selected)\n- Section Title 8:70\n\nNow Script B: business components part 1:\n- Change Pill set (Gain/Loss) — pill with arrow icon + text\n- Balance Card\n- Action Pill set (Primary/Neutral)\n- Trend Card\n- Stock Row\n- Rec Card\n- Index Card\n\nChange Pill: AL H gap 3 pad H8 V4 radius 999, fill brand 0.16 opacity, center: icon up/down rescaled 10 (gain → brand-bright green? use gain color), text 12 SemiBold. Variants State=Gain (up, gain color, fill gain 0.14) / Loss (down, loss color, fill loss 0.14). Text override + arrow swap per use. For balance: \"Rp206.920 (10,79%)\".\n\nBalance Card: component 343×116 vertical AL pad 20 gap 6, fill s1 radius 16: label 'Dana Utama' 12 Medium sec; amount 'Rp2.125.000' 28 Bold txt; ChangePill instance Gain text 'Rp206.920 (10,79%)'.\n\nAction Pill: AL H gap 8 pad L20 R20, height fixed 44 (counterAxisSizing FIXED, primary AUTO? want fixed width per usage — set primary hug; in usage set width by resize or layoutSizing). Simpler: hug width; in screens, place in row with SPACE_BETWEEN. Variants Type=Primary (fill brand, text/icon white) / Neutral (fill s1, stroke line, text txt). Icon placeholder deposit → swap (withdraw for Tarik). Text: Deposit/Tarik 14 SemiBold.\n\nTrend Card: 109×~96 vertical AL pad 12 gap 6 fill s1 radius 12, hug height: logo slot frame 32×32 (fill none, center AL) with Logo_BRRI instance 24 inside (rescale 24/24=1, it's 24×24 already); ticker 14 SemiBold; price 13 Medium txt; change 11 Medium gain.\n\nStock Row: 343×50 AL H gap 12 counter CENTER, fills none, pad V? fixed height 50. Children: logo slot 40×40 (AL center, fill s2? for marks maybe no bg; put fill s2 radius 20 circle-ish? marks are colored vectors; bg s2 circle looks go