{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ/ (fileKey K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ). The user asked (in Chinese): read the design task in「00·Start Here」， follow visual specs in「01·Foundations」， reuse components from「02·Components」， use assets from「04·Media」， and deliver the complete design to「03·Workspace」. Benchmark rules: confirm account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami (DONE, confirmed); use only this assigned file; preserve all reference pages and their nodes; create the complete design inside 03 · Workspace (page 5:2, initially empty); new frames/components/prototype connections allowed there; every assistant message with tool calls must begin with a line \"Reasoning summary:\"; use get_screenshot to verify all screens; finish with the file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations. This is an unattended session — resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting.\n\n   The brief (from page 0:1, frame 4:2 \"Start Here · Brief\"): Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode, canvas 375×812). Build EXACTLY 6 frames named exactly: 01_Aktivitas, 02_Trending, 03_Detail_Saham, 04_Top_Up_Metode, 05_Top_Up_Nominal, 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran — one state per frame, wired as a clickable prototype with listed links. Brand primary #279646, Roboto, dark mode are FIXED; all other colors/type scale/spacing/radii/elevation are mine to define consistently. All other states, headers, tab bar, tabs, chips, and every business component must be reusable components in the workspace. Copy/data must match \"Fixed data\" exactly (Indonesian format: Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%; minus sign − U+2212).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code ≤50k chars per call, must load fonts before text ops: await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style}))\n   - figma.combineAsVariants(nodes, parent) — requires nodes already parented on same page as parent → always page.appendChild(component) immediately after figma.createComponent()\n   - layoutSizingHorizontal/Vertical can only be set on nodes already inside an auto-layout frame → append first, then set sizing\n   - Instance overrides: text.characters override via findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'), icon swap via instanceNode.swapComponent(component), vector recolor via findOne(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').fills, nested variant state via setProperties({State:'Active'})\n   - node.rescale(scale) to resize icon instances (e.g., 24px icon → 10px: rescale(10/24))\n   - Reactions for prototype: node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'ON_TAP'}, action:{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE'}}]\n   - get_metadata for page structure; get_screenshot for verification\n   - Design tokens: bg #0C0E0D{r:0.047,g:0.055,b:0.051}; s1 #161A18{0.086,0.102,0.094}; s2 #1E2321{0.118,0.137,0.129}; s3 #262C29{0.149,0.173,0.161}; line #272D2A{0.153,0.176,0.165}; txt #F2F2F2{0.949...}; sec #A9B2AC{0.663,0.698,0.675}; ter #707A74{0.439,0.478,0.455}; brand #279646{0.153,0.588,0.275}; brandB #2EAE53{0.180,0.682,0.325}; gain #3ECF7E{0.243,0.812,0.494}; loss #F65B5B{0.965,0.357,0.357}; white {1,1,1}\n   - Helper pattern reused in every script: solid(c,o)=>({type:'SOLID',color:c,opacity:o}); T(chars,size,style,color,name,lh) creates Roboto text; ic(key,size,color,name) creates icon instance with rescale+recolor\n   - Roboto styles available: Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Bold all confirmed via listAvailableFontsAsync\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ, 5 pages: 0:1 (00 · Start Here 设计任务)， 1:2 (01 · Foundations), 1:3 (02 · Components), 1:4 (04 · Media), 5:2 (03 · Workspace — BUILD TARGET, was empty)\n   \n   - Reference component IDs (in 02 · Components / 04 · Media, do NOT modify, only create instances):\n     - Button 1:22 (335×48, fill #279646, radius 8, text \"Bayar\" Roboto Medium 16 white, centered) — use as instance for primary buttons (Bayar/Oke/Beli), override label text\n     - Text Field 1:25 (335×48, pad 16, fill ~#25242F, radius 8, placeholder \"Minimal Rp10.000\" Roboto Regular 14 #8C8C99) — use as instance on screen 05 (resize to 343×48)\n     - Status Bar 1:30 (375×44, transparent bg, white glyphs); Home Indicator 1:40 (375×34, 134×5 white bar at y=21) — place on every frame (status at y=0, home at y=778)\n     - Icons: menu 2:4, settings 2:7, Arrow_Up 2:10, Arrow_Down 2:13, deposit 2:20, withdraw 2:27, plus 2:30, Tab_Aktivitas 2:33, Tab_Trending 2:36, Tab_Pasar 2:39, Tab_Profil 2:42, Chevron_Down 2:45, Chevron_Right 2:48, back 2:52, share 2:58, star 2:61, help 2:65, ATM 2:69, Debit_Card 2:75, Mobile_Banking 2:80, Store 2:87, Copy 2:91\n     - Image logos (96×96): ABNB 3:47, ADRO 3:48, BBRI 3:44, GOTO 3:45, UNVR 3:46\n     - Ticker marks (24×24 vectors): AMRI 3:35, ARB 3:11, BRRI 3:5, DAN 3:27, DHDI 3:23, FSX 3:19, ODD 3:39, PYQ 3:43, ROTI 3:31\n\n   - Components CREATED in workspace page 5:2 (node names critical for overrides):\n     - Tab Item set 8:10 — variants State=Default / State=Active; vertical AL, pad 8/10, gap 4; children 'Icon' (icon instance, placeholder Icon_Tab_Aktivitas 20px) + 'Label' (Roboto Medium 10); Default=ter color, Active=brand\n     - Tab Bar 8:11 — 375×64, fill s1, strokeTopWeight 1 line color; AL H SPACE_BETWEEN pad 8/6/8/10; 5 instances named 'Tab / Aktivitas','Tab / Trending','Tab / Top Up','Tab / Pasar','Tab / Profil'; each contains nested 'Icon' instance + 'Label' text; Top Up tab uses Icon_Plus 24px (others 20px)\n     - Header / Home 8:36 — 375×48, title 'Title' (Roboto SemiBold 20, default \"Aktivitas\") + 'Actions' frame with 'Menu','Settings' 24px icons\n     - Header / Back 8:43 — 'Back' icon + 'Title' (\"Top Up\", SemiBold 16) + 'Help' icon\n     - Header / Detail 8:51 — 'Back' icon + 'Actions' frame with 'Plus','Share','Star'\n     - Chip set 8:69 — variants State=Default (fill s2, text sec) / State=Selected (fill brand, text white); pad 12/6, radius 999, 'Label' Roboto Medium 13\n     - Section Title 8:70 — 'Title' SemiBold 16 txt, default \"Watchlist Saya\"\n     - Change Pill set 10:10 — variants State=Gain / State=Loss; fill gain/loss @0.14 opacity, radius 999; 'Arrow' (icon up/down rescaled 10) + 'Label' (\"Rp206.920 (10,79%)\" SemiBold 12)\n     - Balance Card 10:11 — 343×116, fill s1, radius 16, pad 20/18; 'Label' (\"Dana Utama\" 12 Medium sec), 'Amount' (\"Rp2.125.000\" 28 Bold txt), 'Change' (Change Pill instance)\n     - Action Pill set 10:34 — variants Type=Primary (fill brand, white) / Type=Neutral (fill s1, stroke line); 44 tall, pad 22, gap 8; 'Icon' (deposit 20px placeholder) + 'Label' (Deposit/Tarik SemiBold 14)\n     - Trend Card 10:35 — vertical AL pad 12 gap 6, fill s1 radius 12; 'LogoSlot' (32×32, fill s2, radius 16, center AL) > 'Logo' (Logo_BRRI 24px instance); 'Ticker' 14 SemiBold, 'Price' 13 Medium, 'Change' 11 Medium gain\n     - Stock Row 10:43 — 343×50 AL H gap 12 center; 'LogoSlot' (40×40, fill s2, radius 20) > 'Logo' (Logo_BRRI rescaled 40/24); 'Names' (layoutGrow 1) > 'Ticker' 15 SemiBold + 'Company' 12 Regular sec; 'Values' (counterAxisAlignItems MAX) > 'Price' 15 Medium + 'Change' 12 Medium\n     - Rec Card 10:54 — 109×96, fill s1 radius 12, pad 12 gap 5; 'Badge' (32×32 fill s2 radius 8, center) > 'Ticker' text 10 SemiBold brandB; 'Company' 12 Regular (textAutoResize HEIGHT, fixed width); 'Price' 13 Medium; 'Change' 11 Medium\n     - Index Card 10:60 — 109×58, fill s1 radius 12, pad 12/10 gap 4; 'Name' 11 Medium ter; 'ValueRow' > 'Value' 14 SemiBold + 'Arrow' (icon up 10px gain)\n   - Component positions: Tab Item (0,980), Tab Bar (180,980), Headers (580,980/1040/1100), Chip (980,980), Section Title (980,1060), Change Pill (0,1240), Balance Card (140,1240), Action Pill (520,1240), Trend Card (900,1240), Stock Row (1040,1240), Rec Card (1410,1240), Index Card (1410,1360); label text 'Components' at (0,940)\n\n   - Key code pattern (every script must include):\n```js\nconst page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:2');\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style:s});\nconst C = { bg:{r:0.047,g:0.055,b:0.051}, s1:{r:0.086,g:0.102,b:0.094}, s2:{r:0.118,g:0.137,b:0.129}, line:{r:0.153,g:0.176,b:0.165}, txt:{r:0.949,g:0.949,b:0.949}, sec:{r:0.663,g:0.698,b:0.675}, ter:{r:0.439,g:0.478,b:0.455}, brand:{r:0.153,g:0.588,b:0.275}, brandB:{r:0.180,g:0.682,b:0.325}, gain:{r:0.243,g:0.812,b:0.494}, loss:{r:0.965,g:0.357,b:0.357}, white:{r:1,g:1,b:1} };\nconst solid=(c,o)=>({type:'SOLID',color:c,opacity:(o===undefined?1:o)});\nfunction T(chars,size,style,color,name,lh){ const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:'Roboto',style}; t.fontSize=size; t.characters=chars; t.fills=[solid(color)]; if(name)t.name=name; if(lh)t.lineHeight={value:lh,unit:'PIXELS'}; return t; }\n// IMPORTANT: after figma.createComponent() ALWAYS page.appendChild(c) before further config\n```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - Error 1: \"in combineAsVariants: Grouped nodes must be in the same page as the parent\" — components created via figma.createComponent() land on figma.currentPage, not necessarily 5:2. Fix: call page.appendChild(c) immediately after every figma.createComponent() before combineAsVariants. Verified removed=0 strays in cleanup (they were on another page but first cleanup loop found none on other pages since execution stopped before they were added elsewhere—recreate worked).\n   - Error 2: \"in set_layoutSizingVertical: node must be an auto-layout frame or a child of an auto-layout frame\" — set layoutSizing on a text node before appending it to the auto-layout parent (Rec Card Company text). Fix: rc.appendChild(comp) FIRST, then comp.layoutSizingHorizontal='FIXED'; comp.layoutSizingVertical='HUG'. Had to delete the 5 partially-created components (cleanup by name list) and re-run the whole script.\n   - No user feedback corrections received (unattended session).\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Screen layouts planned to fit 375×812 with status bar (44) + tab bar (64, y=714) + home indicator (34, y=778) on screens 01/02/04/05; screens 03/06 have no tab bar (content limit ~778). Screen x positions: 01→x=0, 02→x=475, 03→x=950, 04→x=1425, 05→x=1900, 06→x=2375, all y=0.\n   - 01 layout: Header y=52; Balance Card y=108; Action pills y=232; \"Trending Hari ini\" y=292 + 3 Trend Cards y=318; \"Watchlist Saya\"+Icon_Plus y=430; 5 Stock Rows y=458 (48 each) → 698. Tab active: Aktivitas.\n   - 02 layout: Header y=52; 3 Index Cards y=104 h56; Market chips y=172 (Global selected); \"Rekomendasi\" y=213 + 3 Rec Cards y=237 h88; Region chips y=337 (Asia selected); Trending title row y=378 (\"Trending\" + \"24 jam\"+Chevron_Down left, \"Lihat Semua\"+Chevron_Right right); 6 Stock Rows y=404 (50 each) → 704. Tab active: Trending.\n   - 03 layout (no tab bar): Header/Detail y=52; stock block (Logo_GOTO 48 + GOTO/GoTo Gojek Tokopedia) y=108; price row Rp189 (24 Bold) + −Rp9 (−4,55%) loss + \"Hari ini\"; 8 range chips y~200 (1D selected, font 11 pad 8/5); Chart card y~240 h~170; Keystats 2-col grid 4 rows; Dibandingkan dengan 3 compact rows; Beli (given Button instance)/Jual (secondary) pinned bottom. Back icon → 02.\n   - 04 layout: Header/Back y=52; \"Dana Saya\" Rp2.125.000 strip; \"Pilih Metode\" + 5 Method Rows h60 (ATM, Kartu Debit, Mobile Banking, Indomaret, Alfamart — icon swap in 40×40 tile, chevron right). Tab active: Top Up. Alfamart row → 05; back → 01.\n   - 05 layout: Header/Back; Stepper (step 1 \"Masukkan Nominal\" current, step 2 \"Pembayaran\"); \"Top Up ke\" Alfamart card + \"Ganti\"; \"Pilih Nominal Top Up\" 2-col grid of 6 Amount Options (Rp500.000 Selected); \"Atau masukkan nominal di sini\" + Text Field 1:25 instance (343×48, placeholder \"Minimal Rp10.000\", empty); Bayar button (given Button instance) pinned. Tab active: Top Up.\n   - 06 layout (no tab bar): Title \"Selesaikan Pembayaran\" + \"Silakan selesaikan proses pembayaran\"; countdown card (\"Bayar Sebelum\", \"Minggu, 30 Oktober 2022, 13:32 WIB\", \"00 : 08 : 46\" brand green); payment card (No Transaksi FD8U4J38J004093J8U80TJ039; Nominal Rp500.000; Kode Pembayaran 1111000065665144 + Icon_Copy); \"Panduan Pembayaran\" 6 Guide Steps; Oke button → 01.\n   - Chart plan (component 'Chart · Price 1D'): card 343×~176 pad 12; plot 319×112; x points 0,63.8,127.6,191.4,255.2,319; values 197,199,194,196,192,189 → y=8+(199−v)*9.6 → 27.2,8,56,36.8,75.2,104; line vector (vectorPaths \"M 0 27.2 L 63.8 8 L 127.6 56 L 191.4 36.8 L 255.2 75.2 L 319 104\") stroke brandB 2 round; area path closed to bottom with vertical gradient brand 0.28→0 (gradientTransform [[0,1,0],[-1,0,1]]); highlight at (255.2,75.2): dashed hairline vertical, white dot 8px, brand ring; Tooltip component (\"Rp192\" 13 SemiBold / \"28 Okt 2022 - 22:00\" 10 / \"Volume: 102K\" 10) placed left-above point; x labels 6:00 10:00 14:00 18:00 22:00 2:00.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - Initial message (Chinese): “请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计：Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。” (Plus the system/benchmark framing: assigned file only; whoami first and confirm zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai; preserve reference pages; deliver in 03 · Workspace; unattended session; finish with file URL, page ID, screen IDs, prototype work, limitations; \"Reasoning summary:\" before every tool call.)\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Script C: create remaining components — Method Row (icon tile 40×40 + label 15 Medium + Chevron_Right, swap icon: atm/debit/mobile/store), Amount Option set (State=Default/Selected, radio + amount text, e.g. Rp500.000), Stepper (1 Masukkan Nominal current / 2 Pembayaran), Key Stat Cell (label 11 ter + value 13 Medium), Compare Row (company+ticker left, price+change right), Payment Row (label + value), Guide Step (number circle + 11px text), Tooltip, Button/Secondary (343×48 fill s1 stroke line radius 8, for Jual), Chart · Price 1D\n   - Scripts D–H: build the 6 screens (375×812, exact names 01_Aktivitas … 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran) with exact fixed data (below), status bar (1:30) + home indicator (1:40) instances, tab bar instances with active tab via nested setProperties\n   - Wire prototype reactions: 01: Deposit→04, Trending tab→02, Top Up tab→04; 02: GOTO row→03, Aktivitas tab→01, Top Up tab→04; 03: back→02; 04: Alfamart row→05, back→01; 05: Bayar→06, back/Ganti→04; 06: Oke→01\n   - get_screenshot all 6 screens, fix visible issues, re-verify\n   - Final answer with file URL, page ID 5:2, screen IDs, prototype summary, limitations\n\n   FIXED DATA (verbatim, Indonesian format, − is U+2212):\n   - Balance: Dana Utama Rp2.125.000, ▲ Rp206.920 (10,79%); Dana Saya Rp2.125.000\n   - Trending Hari ini: BRRI 8.600 +50 (+0,58%); ARB 8.600 +50 (+0,58%); FSX 8.600 +50 (+0,58%)\n   - Watchlist: DHDI · PT Duatiga Pertama · 8.600 · +50 (+0,58%); AMRI · PT Atma Merapi · 2.421 · −121 (−4,76%); ODD · PT Okufo Dokuri · 5.300 · +31 (+0,59%); PYQ · PT Pimnas Yosque · 3.867 · −71 (−1,80%); DAN · PT Danang Amin · 6.600 · −201 (−2,96%)\n   - Indices: IHSG 7.206,92 rising; NIKKEI 27.105,20 falling; SENSEX 59.959,85 rising\n   - Trending 24 jam: ROTI · Nippon Indosari Tbk · 8.600 · +50 (+0,58%); GOTO · GoTo Gojek Tokopedia · 189 · −9 (−4,55%); ABNB · Airbnb Inc · 5.300 · +31 (+0,59%); UNVR · Unilever Indonesia · 3.867 · −71 (−1,80%); BBRI · Bank Rakyat Indonesia · 4.630 · +38 (+0,83%); ADRO · Adaro Energy Indonesia · 3.600 · +21 (+0,59%)\n   - Rekomendasi (text badges, no logos): NFLX · Netflix, Inc · 2.122.340 · −0,20%; META · Meta Platforms · 987.890 · +1,29%; AMZN · Amazon.com, Inc · 1.001.333 · −6,20%\n   - GOTO detail: Logo_GOTO · GOTO · GoTo Gojek Tokopedia · Rp189 · −Rp9 (−4,55%) · \"Hari ini\"\n   - Chart: 6:00 197 · 10:00 199 · 14:00 194 · 18:00 196 · 22:00 192 · 2:00 189; tooltip on 22:00: Rp192 · 28 Okt 2022 - 22:00 · Volume: 102K\n   - Keystats: Previous Close Rp198; Day Range Rp188 - Rp199; Year Range Rp180 - Rp396; Market Cap 694,70T IDR; AVG Volume 167,58M; P/E Ratio 15,50; Dividend Yield 3,76%; Primary Exchange IDX\n   - Dibandingkan dengan: Bukalapak Tbk · BUKA · Rp276 · +2,82%; Bank Rakyat Indonesia · BBRI · Rp4.630 · +0,83%; PT Industri Jamu · SIDO · Rp740 · +2,82%\n   - Pembayaran: No Transaksi FD8U4J38J004093J8U80TJ039; Nominal Rp500.000; Kode Pembayaran 1111000065665144\n   - Countdown: Bayar Sebelum · Minggu, 30 Oktober 2022, 13:32 WIB · 00 : 08 : 46\n   - Panduan Pembayaran (6 steps): 1. Catat kode pembayaran di atas dan datang ke gerai Alfamart, Alfa Midi, Lawson atau DAN+DAN terdekat. 2. Beritahukan ke kasir bahwa Anda ingin melakukan pembayaran. 3. Kasir akan menanyakan kode pembayaran. Berikan kode pembayaran Anda 1111000065665144. 4. Kasir akan melakukan konfirmasi data konsumen berupa Nama Merchant, Nama Konsumen, dan Nominal. Lakukan pembayaran ke kasir sejumlah nominal yang disebutkan. 5. Terima struk sebagai bukti pembayaran sudah sukses dilakukan. Notifikasi pembayaran akan langsung diterima oleh Merchant. 6. Selesai.\n   - Top Up 05 options: Rp50.000, Rp100.000, Rp200.000, Rp300.000, Rp500.000 (selected), Rp1.000.000; custom field placeholder \"Minimal Rp10.000\" empty\n   - Tab bar: Aktivitas/Trending/Top Up/Pasar/Profil; active: Aktivitas on 01, Trending on 02, Top Up on 04+05; none on 03+06\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Just completed Script B (second attempt) creating business components batch 1 in workspace page 5:2. Result: \"Change Pill 10:10, Balance Card 10:11, Action Pill 10:34, Trend Card 10:35, Stock Row 10:43, Rec Card 10:54, Index Card 10:60\" — all created successfully with the append-before-sizing fix. 14 components now exist in the workspace components area (y≈940–1360).\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Run Script C via mcp__figma__use_figma to create the remaining business components (Method Row, Amount Option set with variants Default/Selected, Stepper, Key Stat Cell, Compare Row, Payment Row, Guide Step, Tooltip, Button/Secondary, Chart · Price 1D with the exact chart math documented above), then proceed to build screen 01_Aktivitas. This continues the planned build sequence: \"Script C: components part 3 (Method Row, Amount Option, Stepper, KeyStat, Compare Row, Payment Row, Guide Step, Tooltip, Button/Secondary, Chart)\" → \"Scripts D-H screens\" → \"prototype wiring\" → \"get_screenshot verification\". Remember the two fixes when writing: page.appendChild(component) immediately after createComponent, and append nodes to auto-layout parents before setting layoutSizing properties.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /mnt/afs/huangxinyue/bench-runs/10case-6models-v4-20261101/runs/TEST-033_1793479602734/claude-config/projects/-mnt-afs-huangxinyue-bench-runs-10case-6models-v4-20261101-workspace/9a1582c6-6201-4705-96fb-bb880f77176a.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9a1582c6-6201-4705-96fb-bb880f77176a","uuid":"e5813d4e-54ba-4ff2-a518-33498443f9cb","