{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ/ (fileKey K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ). Original user request (Chinese): read the design task in「00·Start Here」， follow visual specs in「01·Foundations」， reuse components from「02·Components」， use assets from「04·Media」， deliver the complete design to「03·Workspace」. Benchmark rules: confirm account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami (DONE, confirmed in earlier session); use only this assigned file; preserve all reference pages and their nodes; create the complete design inside 03 · Workspace (page 5:2); new frames/components/prototype connections allowed there; every assistant message with tool calls must begin with a line \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response format: 'Reasoning summary: ...' on first line then 'Final answer:'; use get_screenshot to verify ALL screens, fix visible problems, re-verify; unattended session (resolve routine choices from brief without waiting); finish with the assigned file URL, the 03 · Workspace page ID, the screen IDs, the prototype work completed and any remaining limitations; do not claim completion for unfinished work.\n\n   The brief (from page 0:1): Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode, canvas 375×812). Build EXACTLY 6 frames named exactly: 01_Aktivitas, 02_Trending, 03_Detail_Saham, 04_Top_Up_Metode, 05_Top_Up_Nominal, 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran — one state per frame, wired as a clickable prototype. Brand primary #279646, Roboto, dark mode are FIXED; all other colors/type scale/spacing my choice, applied consistently. All business components must be reusable components in the workspace. Copy/data must match \"Fixed data\" exactly (Indonesian format: Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%; minus sign − U+2212).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code ≤50k chars; load fonts first: await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style})); failed calls roll back entirely (atomic)\n   - THIS ENVIRONMENT'S QUIRKS (critical):\n     - COMPONENT_SET has NO createInstance; figma.createComponentFromNode(set) also fails → use set.children.find(c=>c.name==='Type=X').createInstance() then inst.setProperties({...})\n     - Nested instance .rescale() fails (\"This property cannot be overridden in an instance: size\") but swapComponent() PRESERVES instance size (24×24 stays 24×24 even swapping a 96×96 component in); nested resize() works\n     - figma.appendChild() returns null — never chain property assignment on its return value\n     - INSTANCE nodes have NO componentId property — match instances by name (n.name==='Tab Bar' / 'Header / Back' / 'Header / Detail' / 'Button')\n     - Reactions schema: node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',navigation:'NAVIGATE',destinationId:'X:Y',transition:{type:'SMART_ANIMATE',easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'},duration:0.3}}]}] — note `actions` (array) NOT `action`; ON_CLICK not ON_TAP; transition required (INSTANT invalid; SMART_ANIMATE/DISSOLVE need easing+duration; SLIDE_IN/MOVE_IN etc. need direction+matchLayers+easing+duration)\n   - Auto-layout components with hug width: instances created BEFORE a component width-fix keep the old width as a size override → after fixing a component's width, DELETE and recreate its instances\n   - layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL' works on instances inside auto-layout\n   - Design tokens: bg #0C0E0D{0.047,0.055,0.051}; s1 #161A18{0.086,0.102,0.094}; s2 #1E2321{0.118,0.137,0.129}; s3 #262C29{0.149,0.173,0.161}; line #272D2A{0.153,0.176,0.165}; txt #F2F2F2{0.949,0.949,0.949}; sec #A9B2AC{0.663,0.698,0.675}; ter #707A74{0.439,0.478,0.455}; brand #279646{0.153,0.588,0.275}; brandB #2EAE53{0.180,0.682,0.325}; gain #3ECF7E{0.243,0.812,0.494}; loss #F65B5B{0.965,0.357,0.357}; white {1,1,1}\n   - Helper pattern: solid(c,o)=>({type:'SOLID',color:c,opacity:o}); T(chars,size,style,color,name,lh) creates Roboto text; txt(n,name)=n.findOne(x=>x.name===name&&x.type==='TEXT'); setLogo(inst,comp)=inst.findOne(n=>n.name==='Logo').swapComponent(comp)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ, 5 pages: 0:1 (00 · Start Here), 1:2 (01 · Foundations), 1:3 (02 · Components), 1:4 (04 · Media), 5:2 (03 · Workspace — BUILD TARGET)\n   - Reference components (do NOT modify): Button 1:22 (335×48, text 'Bayar'), Text Field 1:25 (placeholder 'Minimal Rp10.000'), Status Bar 1:30 (375×44), Home Indicator 1:40 (place y=778); icons: menu 2:4, settings 2:7, Arrow_Up 2:10, Arrow_Down 2:13, deposit 2:20, withdraw 2:27, plus 2:30, Chevron_Down 2:45, Chevron_Right 2:48, back 2:52, share 2:58, star 2:61, help 2:65, ATM 2:69, Debit_Card 2:75, Mobile_Banking 2:80, Store 2:87, Copy 2:91; image logos (96×96): ABNB 3:47, ADRO 3:48, BBRI 3:44, GOTO 3:45, UNVR 3:46; ticker marks (24×24): AMRI 3:35, ARB 3:11, BRRI 3:5, DAN 3:27, DHDI 3:23, FSX 3:19, ODD 3:39, PYQ 3:43, ROTI 3:31\n\n   - Workspace components created (page 5:2):\n     - From earlier session: Tab Item set 8:10 (State=Default/Active), Tab Bar 8:11 (375×64; children named 'Tab / Aktivitas','Tab / Trending','Tab / Top Up','Tab / Pasar','Tab / Profil'), Header / Home 8:36 ('Title'+'Menu'+'Settings'), Header / Back 8:43 ('Back'+'Title'+'Help'), Header / Detail 8:51 ('Back'+'Actions'>'Plus','Share','Star'), Chip set 8:69 (State=Default/Selected, 'Label'), Section Title 8:70 ('Title'), Change Pill set 10:10 (State=Gain/Loss, 'Arrow'+'Label'), Balance Card 10:11 ('Label','Amount','Change'), Action Pill set 10:34 (Type=Primary/Neutral, 'Icon'+'Label'), Trend Card 10:35 ('LogoSl