ange \"+50 (+0,58%)\" is CUT OFF at bottom of card (partially visible). The card height seems too small — change pill clipped. Actually I see \"+50 (+0,58%)\" half-clipped at card bottom.\n\nAnd Balance Card looks good. Header fine.\n\nBig issue: In 01, between \"Trending Hari ini\" cards and \"Watchlist Saya\" — the row logos overlap the section title. It looks like stock row logos are rendered ABOVE their row (shifted up-left?) or the rows are overlapping the section heading.\n\nWait, actually I think what happened: the Stock Row component's LogoSlot contains a 48px logo (not 24) — no wait, swapComponent preserves size...\n\nHmm, let me look again at screen 01 rows:\n- Row 1 (y≈458): big orange logo at left, overlapping text; \"8.600\" at top-right area, \"+50 (+0,58%)\" below in green.\n- The ticker \"DHDI\" and company \"PT Duatiga Pertama\" are NOT visible at all!\n\nSimilarly screen 02 rows: logo visible, price+change visible, but ticker/company invisible.\n\nSo the text column (Ticker+Company) is missing/overlapped. Why? The logo overlaps it — the logo appears to be ~48px and positioned at x≈12, while ticker/company text starts at x≈48 behind the logo?\n\nActually in screen 02, I can see faint text behind logos? E.g., row 1 \"ROTI/Nippon Indosari\" — I see \"ing\" text peeking out from behind the goto logo... wait no, that's \"Trending\" heading behind the ROTI logo! \"24 jam\" is visible and \"...ing\" — the section header \"Trending\" is partially hidden behind the first stock row's logo!\n\nOH I see now. The LOGOS ARE SHIFTED UP by roughly one row height! In screen 02: first stock row (ROTI) at y=404 — its logo appears at y≈420 overlapping the \"Trending\" section header at y=378-400. The other logos (goto at row2 y≈505...) appear at the left edge of each row. Hmm, actually goto logo is at row 2 position correctly.\n\nWait: rows at y=404,454,504,554,604,654. In screenshot: ROTI logo ≈ y 420-460 (overlapping Trending header which is at 404-427 area of image