{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_dc8bff0cb05b42008bb259b4","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const out=[];\nconst p0=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='0:1');\nconst cards=p0.children[0];\nout.push(`cards frame: ${cards.name} ${cards.id} ${Math.round(cards.width)}x${Math.round(cards.height)} children=${cards.children.length}`);\nfor(const c of cards.children){\n  out.push(`  ${c.name} ${c.id} ${Math.round(c.width)}x${Math.round(c.height)} type=${c.type} kids=${c.children?c.children.length:0}`);\n  if(c.children&&c.children.length){\n    out.push('    kids: '+c.children.slice(0,8).map(k=>k.name).join(', '));\n  }\n}\nconst f12=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='1:2');\nout.push('1:2 children='+f12.children.length);\nconst f13=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='1:3');\nout.push('1:3: '+f13.children.map(c=>c.name+' '+c.id+' '+c.type).join(' | '));\nconst sb=figma.getNodeById('1:30');\nout.push('StatusBar 1:30 exists='+(!!sb));\nreturn out.join('\\n');","description":"Inspect Frame cards children on page 0:1 and check reference pages state","fileKey":"K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ"}}],"id":"f98b96d7-b077-4cfa-9b65-e7609136431c","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9a1582c6-6201-4705-96fb-bb880f77176a","uuid":"7ddd74ca-c9dd-4de2-82df-5e3f4fa9c183","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:31:08.040Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_dc8bff0cb05b42008bb259b4","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_dc8bff0cb05b42008bb259b4","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"cards frame: Start Here · Brief 4:2 1440x4091 children=7\n  Header 4:3 1312x170 type=FRAME kids=3\n    kids: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2, Stock Trading — Indonesian stock investing app, Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode): see your main balance, today’s trending tickers and your watchlist, browse global trending stocks, open the GOTO stock detail, and top up your balance at Alfamart up to the payment code. Canvas 375 × 812, dark mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  How to work 4:7 1312x249 type=FRAME kids=2\n    kids: How to work, 1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color, the typeface and dark mode in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (dark background and surface levels, neutrals, text, gain / loss, selected, warning, error / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, tabs and chips, and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the company logos, ticker marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly (Indonesian number format: Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%). This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\n  Frames · goals · must include · links 4:10 1312x1325 type=FRAME kids=3\n    kids: Frames · goals · must include · links, Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks., Frame cards\n  Navigation structure 4:56 1312x183 type=FRAME kids=2\n    kids: Navigation structure, • Bottom tab bar with 5 tabs in this order: Aktivitas (Icon_Tab_Aktivitas), Trending (Icon_Tab_Trending), Top Up (Icon_Plus), Pasar (Icon_Tab_Pasar), Profil (Icon_Tab_Profil). Current tab: Aktivitas on 01, Trending on 02, Top Up on 04 and 05. 03 and 06 have no tab bar. How the current tab looks is yours. • Browse flow: 01_Aktivitas → 02_Trending → 03_Detail_Saham (GOTO). • Top-up flow: 01_Aktivitas (Deposit or Top Up tab) → 04_Top_Up_Metode → 05_Top_Up_Nominal (Alfamart) → 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran → Oke → 01_Aktivitas. • Entry only (no frame): menu, settings, Tarik, watchlist add, other tickers, Crypto / Reksadana / CFD, Eropa / Amerika / Mata Uang, 24 jam, Lihat Semua, Rekomendasi cards, range tabs other than 1D, add / share / favorite, Jual, Beli, compare items, ATM / Kartu Debit / Mobile Banking / Indomaret, help, copy code, Pasar, Profil.\n  Fixed data & copy 4:59 1312x1155 type=FRAME kids=3\n    kids: Fixed data & copy, Use these values verbatim. Bahasa Indonesia; prices in rupiah; Indonesian number format (“.” thousands, “,” decimals)., Data blocks\n  What is fixed · what is yours 4:96 1312x312 type=FRAME kids=2\n    kids: What is fixed · what is yours, Fixed vs yours\n  How it is evaluated 4:105 1312x281 type=FRAME kids=4\n    kids: How it is evaluated, Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original., 1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, selected tab / chip / range / amount, current step, rising / falling, empty field), Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 6 named frames, your components and the prototype.\n1:2 children=0\n1:3: Components 1:18 FRAME\nStatusBar 1:30 exists=true"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9a1582c6-6201-4705-96fb-bb880f77176a","uuid":"449a20ab-a778-47b0-b75a-673b93e7f8b7","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:31:14.536Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"cards frame: Start Here · Brief 4:2 1440x4091 children=7\n  Header 4:3 1312x170 type=FRAME kids=3\n    kids: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2, Stock Trading — Indonesian stock investing app, Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode): see your main balance, today’s trending tickers and your watchlist, browse global trending stocks, open the GOTO stock detail, and top up your balance at Alfamart up to the payment code. Canvas 375 × 812, dark mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  How to work 4:7 1312x249 type=FRAME kids=2\n    kids: How to work, 1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color, the typeface and dark mode in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (dark background and surface levels, neutrals, text, gain / loss, selected, warning, error / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, tabs and chips, and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the company logos,