{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ/ (fileKey K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ). Original user request (Chinese): read the design task in「00·Start Here」， follow visual specs in「01·Foundations」， reuse components from「02·Components」， use assets from「04·Media」， deliver the complete design to「03·Workspace」. Benchmark rules: confirm account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami (DONE in earlier session); use only this assigned file; preserve ALL reference pages and their nodes (including the brief's reference cards 4:14–4:49 inside \"Frame cards\" on page 0:1); deliver inside 03 · Workspace (page 5:2); every assistant message containing tool calls MUST begin with a line \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response format: first line 'Reasoning summary: ...' then 'Final answer:'; use get_screenshot to verify ALL screens, fix visible problems, re-verify — \"A successful screenshot alone is not task completion: finish the required screens, states and prototype flows before the final answer\"; unattended session (resolve routine choices from brief without waiting); finish with the assigned file URL, the 03 · Workspace page ID, the screen IDs, the prototype work completed and any remaining limitations; do not claim completion for unfinished work.\n\n   The brief (page 0:1, read verbatim this session): Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode, canvas 375×812). Build EXACTLY 6 frames named exactly: 01_Aktivitas, 02_Trending, 03_Detail_Saham, 04_Top_Up_Metode, 05_Top_Up_Nominal, 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran — one state per frame, wired as clickable prototype. Navigation: bottom tab bar with 5 tabs in order Aktivitas, Trending, Top Up (Icon_Plus), Pasar, Profil; current tab Aktivitas on 01, Trending on 02, Top Up on 04 and 05; 03 and 06 have NO tab bar. Flows: 01→02→03(GOTO detail); 01 (Deposit or Top Up tab)→04→05 (Alfamart)→06→Oke→01. Brand primary #279646, Roboto, dark mode FIXED; all other colors/type/spacing my choice, consistent. All business components reusable. Copy/data verbatim (Indonesian format Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%; minus − U+2212).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code ≤50k chars; load fonts: await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style})); failed calls roll back entirely (atomic)\n   - CRITICAL SESSION DISCOVERY — tool view divergence: use_figma's sandbox currently CANNOT see the six screen frames (getNodeById('16:2')→null, figma.root.findAll misses them, page 5:2 children list = 24 components only, Foundations page 1:2 appears empty), while get_metadata and get_screenshot DO see the screens correctly. Mitigation to try next: await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(workspacePage) then re-probe; canonical file state (metadata/screenshot services) HAS the screens.\n   - Environment quirks (from earlier sessions, still applicable): COMPONENT_SET has no createInstance → use set.children.find(c=>c.name==='Type=X').createInstance() + setProperties; nested instance .rescale() fails but swapComponent() preserves size; figma.appendChild() returns null (never chain on return); INSTANCE nodes have no componentId (match by name); top-level instance .resize() works; instances with no size override auto-track component size changes; instances created BEFORE a component width fix keep stale size overrides (delete+recreate OR resize in place)\n   - Reactions schema (working): node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',navigation:'NAVIGATE',destinationId:'X:Y',transition:{type:'SMART_ANIMATE',easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'},duration:0.3}}]}] — `actions` array NOT `action`; ON_CLICK not ON_TAP; transition required\n   - Auto-layout sizing: primaryAxisSizingMode/counterAxisSizingMode 'FIXED'/'AUTO'; child.layoutSizingHorizontal/Vertical 'FIXED'/'HUG'/'FILL'; child.layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE' to float a child in an auto-layout frame; primaryAxisAlignItems='MAX' for right-alignment\n   - THIS SESSION'S ROOT-CAUSE PATTERN: several \"head/container\" frames were created ~100px tall with children vertically centered (y≈40) → contents render ~40px lower than intended; several components regressed to HUG width; instances sized to match old component state kept stale overrides\n   - Design tokens: bg #0C0E0D{0.047,0.055,0.051}; s1 #161A18{0.086,0.102,0.094}; s2 #1E2321{0.118,0.137,0.129}; s3 #262C29{0.149,0.173,0.161}; line #272D2A{0.153,0.176,0.165}; txt #F2F2F2{0.949,0.949,0.949}; sec #A9B2AC{0.663,0.698,0.675}; ter #707A74{0.439,0.478,0.455}; brand #279646{0.153,0.588,0.275}; brandB #2EAE53{0.180,0.682,0.325}; gain #3ECF7E{0.243,0.812,0.494}; loss #F65B5B{0.965,0.357,0.357}; white {1,1,1}\n   - Screenshots: this session has NO shell tool — must use get_screenshot with enableBase64Response:true for inline image inspection\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file K1JM8KrV8Si1stciFJqXfQ, 5 pages: 0:1 (00 · Start Here 设计任务 — contains brief 4:2 \"Start Here · Brief\" 1440×4091 with children Header 4:3, How to work 4:7, Frames·goals·must include·links 4:10 containing \"Frame cards\" with 6 reference frames 4:14/4:21/4:28/4:35/4:42/4:49 named like the screens — PRESERVE, Navigation structure 4:56, Fixed data & copy 4:59, What is fixed·what is yours 4:96, How it is evaluated 4:105), 1:2 (01 · Foundations — appears EMPTY in use_figma view), 1:3 (02 · Components — one child 'Components' 1:18 FRAME; Button 1:22, Text Field 1:25, Status Bar 1:30, Home Indicator 1:40 exist), 1:4 (04 · Media), 5:2 (03 · Workspace — BUILD TARGET)\n   - Reference components (do NOT modify): Button 1:22, Text Field 1:25, Status Bar 1:30, Home Indicator 1:40; icons: menu 2:4, settings 2:7, Arrow_Up 2:10, Arrow_Down 2:13, deposit 2:20, withdraw 2:27, plus 2:30, Chevron_Down 2:45, Chevron_Right 2:48, back 2:52, share 2:58, star 2:61, help 2:65, ATM 2:69, Debit_Card 2:75, Mobile_Banking 2:80, Store 2:87, Copy 2:91; logos 96×96: ABNB 3:47, ADRO 3:48, BBRI 3:44, GOTO 3:45, UNVR 3:46; ticker marks 24×24: AMRI 3:35, ARB 3:11, BRRI 3:5, DAN 3:27, DHDI 3:23, FSX 3:19, ODD 3:39, PYQ 3:43, ROTI 3:31\n\n   - Workspace components (page 5:2, current measured sizes from probe):\n     - Tab Item set 8:10 (60×52, State=Default 8:2/Active 8:6); Tab Bar 8:11 (278×64 — TOO NARROW, should be 375)\n     - Header / Home 8:36 (187×48 HUG; Title grow=0 HUG/HUG 79w; Actions 68w with Menu x=0, Settings x=44 absolute) — FIX: resize 375×48 FIXED, Title grow=1\n     - Header / Back 8:43 (127×48 HUG; Back 24, Title grow=0 51w, Help 24; pad 0,16,0,12) — FIX: resize 375, Title grow=1\n     - Header / Detail 8:51 (168×48 HUG; Back 24; Actions 112w plain frame with Plus x=0, Share x=44, Star x=88) — FIX: resize 375, Actions→auto-layout gap 20 primaryAxisAlignItems='MAX' (or reposition children to x=207/251/295 in 319-wide FILL Actions)\n     - Chip set 8:69 (62×27); Section Title 8:70 (106×19 HUG — OK)\n     - Change Pill set 10:10 (139×22); Balance Card 10:11 (343×117 OK); Action Pill set 10:34 (120×44)\n     - Trend Card 10:35 (89×118 VERTICAL, pad 12; LogoSlot 32, Ticker y50, Price y72, Change y93 h13) — FIX: resize(109,118) FIXED/FIXED\n     - Stock Row 10:43 (152×50 HORIZONTAL HUG, gap 12; LogoSlot 40; Names FILL w=1 with Ticker y0 h18, Company y20 h14; Values FIXED 100 with Price x=61, Change x=29 right-aligned) — FIX: pPrim=FIXED resize(343,50)\n     - Rec Card 10:54 (109×96; Badge 32; Company FIXED 57×15 → mid-word wrap; Price y69; Change y89 h13) — FIX: resize(109,116), Company→85×15 textTruncation='ENDING'\n     - Index Card 10:60 (109×58; Name y10; ValueRow h=100 BROKEN) —