ndices 17:22 (343×100) with Index Cards 17:23/17:30/17:37 (109×58 @x=0/117/234); Market Chips 17:43 (312×100) Chips 17:44/46/48/50; Section Title 17:52; Recs 17:54 (343×100) Rec Cards 17:55/61/67 (109×96); Region Chips 17:73 Chips 17:74/76/78/80; Trending Head 17:82 (343×100: T 17:83 @y=40.5, '24 jam' 17:84 @y=43, Chevron_Down 17:85, 'Lihat Semua' 17:87, Chevron_Right 17:89 — SHIFT BUG); Stock Rows 17:91/104/115/126/137/148 (152×50 @y=404+50i); Tab Bar 17:159; Home Indicator 17:200\n     - 18:2 03_Detail_Saham (@950,0): Status Bar 18:3; Header/Detail 18:13 (168×48); Stock Head 18:35 (160×100: LogoSlot 18:36 48×48 @y=26 with Logo_GOTO 18:37 40×40, Names 18:38 @y=31.5 with GOTO 18:39 + GoTo Gojek Tokopedia 18:40); Price Row 18:41 (230×100: Rp189 18:42 @y=36, Change Pill 18:43 @(79,39), 'Hari ini' 18:48 @(195,43.5)); Ranges 18:49 (309×100) Chip instances 18:50–18:64 (23 tall); Chart 18:66 (343×219); Section Title 18:87; Keystats Grid 18:89 (w=100 h=418 BROKEN: 4 rows 18:90/97/104/111 343×100 @y=0/106/212/318 each with Key Stat Cells 165×40 @x=0,178); Section Title 18:118; Compare Rows 18:120/127/134 (343×36 @y=594/632/670 OK); Action Bar 18:141 (375×64) with Button 18:142 (167×48) + Button/Secondary 18:144 (167×48); Home Indicator 18:146\n     - 20:2 04_Top_Up_Metode (@1425,0): Status Bar 20:3; Header/Back 20:13 (127×48); Dana Saya 20:25 (343×100: texts @y=43/41 — SHIFT BUG); Divider 20:28; Section Title 20:29; Method Rows 20:31/42/50/58/66 (140/184/212/177/167×60 @y=188+68i — STALE WIDTHS); Tab Bar 20:74; Home Indicator 20:115\n     - 20:117 05_Top_Up_Nominal (@1900,0): Status Bar 20:118; Header/Back 20:128; Stepper 20:136 (221×100); Destination 20:146 (343×100: Frame 20:147 @y=34.5 with 'Top Up ke' 20:148 + 'Alfamart' 20:149, 'Ganti' 20:150 @y=42.5 — SHIFT BUG); Section Title 20:151; Amounts 20:153 (w=100 h=320 BROKEN: rows 20:154/161/168 343×100 @y=0/110/220 with Amount Options 165×44 @x=0,178); Custom Label 20:176; Text Field 20:177 (343×48 OK); Button 20:179 (343×48 OK); Tab Bar 20:181; Home Indicator 20:205\n     - 21:2 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran (@2375,0): Status Bar 21:3; Header/Back 21:13; H1 21:25; H2 21:26; Countdown 21:27 (343×90: Bayar Sebelum 21:28 @y=12, Minggu, 30 Oktober 2022, 13:32 WIB 21:29 @y=29, 00 : 08 : 46 21:30 @y=48 — OK); Payment Details 21:31 (343×402: Payment Row instances 21:32/36/40 315×118 @y=14/142/270 — BROKEN heights); Section Title 21:49; Guide Steps 24:42/46/50/54/58/62 (343×30/30/30/45/45/18 @y=442/478/514/550/601/652 — CORRECT); Action Bar 21:75 (375×64) with Button 21:76 (343×48); Home Indicator 21:78\n\n   - PROTOTYPE LINKS WIRED (15, working — reactions live on these nodes; preserve when editing): 01: Deposit pill 16:34→20:2; Tab/Trending in 16:162→17:2; Tab/TopUp→20:2. 02: Stock Row 17:104 (GOTO)→18:2; Tab/Aktivitas in 17:159→16:2; Tab/TopUp→20:2. 03: Header/Detail 18:13 'Back'→17:2. 04: Method Row 20:66 (Alfamart)→20:117; Header/Back 20:13 'Back'→16:2. 05: Button 20:179 (Bayar)→21:2; Header/Back 20:128 'Back'→20:2; 'Ganti' 20:150→20:2. 06: Button 21:76 (Oke)→16:2; Header/Back 21:13 'Back'→20:117\n\n   - FIXED DATA (verbatim, must render exactly): 01: Dana Utama / Rp2.125.000 / ↑Rp206.920 (10,79%) / Deposit+Tarik / Trending Hari ini: BRRI, ARB, FSX all 8.600 +50 (+0,58%) / Watchlist Saya rows: DHDI·PT Duatiga Pertama·8.600·+50 (+0,58%); AMRI·PT Atma Merapi·2.421·−121 (−4,76%); ODD·PT Okufo Dokuri·5.300·+31 (+0,59%); PYQ·PT Pimnas Yosque·3.867·−71 (−1,80%); DAN·PT Danang Amin·6.600·−201 (−2,96%). 02: IHSG 7.206,92 up / NIKKEI 27.105,20 down / SENSEX 59.959,85 up; Global(Selected)/Saham/Reksadana/Obligasi; Rekomendasi: NFLX·Netflix, Inc·2.122.340·−0,20%; META·Meta Platforms·987.890·+1,29%; AMZN·Amazon.com, Inc·1.001.333·−6,20%; Asia(Selected)/Indonesia/Amerika/Eropa; Trending·24 jam⌄·Lihat Semua›; ROTI·Nippon Indosari Tbk·8.600·+50 (+0,58%); GOTO·GoTo Gojek Tokopedia·189·−9 (−4,55%); ABNB·Airbnb Inc·5.300·+31 (+0,59%); UNVR·Unilever Indonesia·3.867·−71 (−1,80%); BBRI·Bank Rakyat Indonesia·4.630·+38 (+0,83%); ADRO·Adaro Energy Indonesia·3.600·+21 (+0,59%). 03: GOTO·GoTo Gojek Tokopedia·Rp189·−Rp9 (−4,55%)·Hari ini; 1D(Selected)/1W/1M/3M/6M/1Y/5Y/Semua; Keystats: Previous Close Rp198 / Day Range Rp188 - Rp199 / Year Range Rp180 - Rp396 / Market Cap 694,70T IDR / AVG Volume 167,58M / P/E Ratio 15,50 / Dividend Yield 3,76% / Primary Exchange IDX; Dibandingkan dengan: Bukalapak Tbk·BUKA·Rp276·+2,82% / Bank Rakyat Indonesia·BBRI·Rp4.630·+0,83% / PT Industri Jamu·SIDO·Rp740·+2,82%; Beli/Jual. 04: Top Up header; Dana Saya·Rp2.125.000; Pilih Metode: ATM/Kartu Debit/Mobile Banking/Indomaret/Alfamart (icons 2:69/2:75/2:80/2:87/2:87). 05: Stepper (Masukkan Nominal active brand / Pembayaran); Top Up ke·Alfamart·Ganti; Pilih Nominal Top Up: Rp50.000/Rp100.000/Rp200.000/Rp300.000/Rp500.000(Selected)/Rp1.000.000; Atau masukkan nominal di sini; Text Field (placeholder Minimal Rp10.000); Bayar. 06: Selesaikan Pembayaran / Silakan selesaikan proses pembayaran; Bayar Sebelum / Minggu, 30 Oktober 2022, 13:32 WIB / 00 : 08 : 46; No Transaksi FD8U4J38J004093J8U80TJ039 / Nominal Rp500.000 / Kode Pembayaran 1111000065665144 (Copy variant); Panduan Pembayaran 6 steps: (1) Catat kode pembayaran... (2) Beritahukan ke kasir... (3) Kasir akan menanyakan kode pembayaran. Berikan kode pembayaran Anda 1111000065665144. (4) Kasir akan melakukan konfirmasi data konsumen berupa Nama Merchant, Nama Konsumen, dan Nominal. Lakukan pembayaran ke kasir sejumlah nominal yang disebutkan. (5) Terima struk sebagai bukti pembayaran sudah sukses dilakukan. Notifikasi pembayaran akan langsung diterima oleh Merchant. (6) Selesai.; Oke button\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - Screenshots returned as URLs only (no shell/curl tool in this session) → fixed by re-calling get_screenshot with enableBase64Response:true for inline images\n   - use_figma getNodeById('16:2'…) returns null and page 5:2 children listing lacks screens, while get_metadata(5:2) shows all 6 screens fully — UNRESOLVED divergence; next attempt: